{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Phoenix Limit Studios (the creators of The Multiverse Trilogy, Alternate Universe and more) comes Unreal Zombies, a fast-paced FPS zombies horror game that brings you into a post-apocalyptic world. This world was once your home, your planet, your life. You\u2019ve been sent to mysterious ruins by a failed science test, and your only goal is to find your way out. As you move forward, you\u2019re going to face weird, creepy, and strong creatures. You play as Rust. A gentleman who, although looks beaten up, can still find joy of himself as he moves forward. From place to place, you find clues as to who destroyed your home, and is up to you to save humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 weapon with few abilities that enhances the gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 maps - Act 1, 4 maps - Act 2, and 2 maps - Act 3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encore mode (Coming soon)</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A New Beginning!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/316c3c066485550eb01c54a597831796222ad0cb.jpg"},{"name":"Zombies in the Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/631a3590f56e3f1ad862289d2b09265f83cf8bc0.jpg"},{"name":"We're meeting G over there","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/4d5abcc6976e289c56d3d3657067813a23f1f3ee.jpg"},{"name":"Frostbite and an Engine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/0db992cd967d61ec60857ad938afa1cbe2cef54b.jpg"},{"name":"HeadTwister!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/4c7847474eac156bc477d16dcb01451b9ed74